&lt;li&gt;Exposure to architectural patterns of a large, high-scale software applications (e.g., well-designed APIs, high volume data pipelines, efficient algorithms, models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test driven development, familiar with A/B testing, incremental delivery and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
