&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical proficiency in machine learning and software engineering, coupled with a strong product-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The capacity to define and structure solutions in ambiguous problem domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor and guide junior engineers, as well as to effectively collaborate across various team boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving high-impact, technically complex initiatives that delivered clear customer or business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with retrieval systems and search technologies is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
