&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build infrastructure that powers our flagship offerings like&amp;nbsp; MLflow, AI Gateway, Databricks Apps, Agent Framework, Agent Bricks, and Foundation Model APIs, to state a few.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve reliability, latency, and efficiency of distributed AI workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with platform, infra, and ML teams to deliver seamless end-to-end experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how developers and data scientists build and interact with AI on Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
