&lt;p&gt;As an Engineering Manager on External Platform, you’ll lead a team of senior engineers working at the intersection of engineering, operations, and platform strategy. You’ll partner closely with some of our largest customers, Legal, and Program Management to translate shared goals into durable, scalable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this team works on our external platforms, the focus is on reliability and extensibility. You will operate the platform supporting our fastest growing products and provide APIs and frameworks that both internal teams and customers built on top of.&amp;nbsp;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys operating in ambiguous, cross-functional spaces, amplifying the impact of strong ICs, and driving outcomes through platform leverage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from our NYC hub or remotely on the East Coast of the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, grow, and support a team of engineers building foundational infrastructure for Figma’s AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customers, engineering and product leaders from across Figma to define the team’s technical strategy and manage the day-to-day project execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach, and develop senior and staff engineers to scale the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roll up your sleeves to engage deeply with technical details and decisions as needed in order to help the team deliver on a robust AI platform with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an inclusive team and culture through thoughtful team-building and hiring practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of engineering management experience leading high-performing, fast-moving teams, ideally in the AI platform space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of total engineering experience, ideally reaching a staff engineering level as an individual contributor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing platform teams with a focus on reliability and extensibility&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of motivating, mentoring, and growing experienced engineering leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling engineering teams and org structure as they grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MCP Infrastructure and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp; LLM, AI gateways&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in adjacent infrastructure domains&lt;/li&gt;
