&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You Might Also Have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two years of university education or equivalent experience, with in-depth knowledge in specific domains of machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Published and presented peer-reviewed articles in top-tier venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in writing high-quality pull requests, maintaining good test coverage, and completing projects with minimal defects.&lt;/li&gt;
