&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience designing, maintaining, and troubleshooting pipelines using GitHub Actions or similar modern CI/CD tools.&lt;/li&gt;
